# SYSC 4806 Lab 4
# 1. Start AddressBookApplication (runs on http://localhost:8080)
# 2. Run requests 1 to 5 in order to create an address book, two buddies, and link them
# 3. Request 6 shows the JSON, request 7 (or the URL below) shows the Thymeleaf page
#    http://localhost:8080/addressbook/{id}   (id = the address book's id, 1 here)
# Note: the database is in-memory (H2), so data is lost when the app stops. Rerun requests 1 to 5 after each start.

### 1. Create an address book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/addressBooks
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2. Create a buddy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/buddyInfoes
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Alice Smith", "phoneNumber": "613-555-0101"}

### 3. Create another buddy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/buddyInfoes
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Bob Chen", "phoneNumber": "613-555-0102"}

### 4. Add buddy 1 to address book 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/addressBooks/1/buddies
Content-Type: text/uri-list

http://localhost:8080/api/buddyInfoes/1

### 5. Add buddy 2 to address book 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/addressBooks/1/buddies
Content-Type: text/uri-list

http://localhost:8080/api/buddyInfoes/2

### 6. Check the result as JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/api/addressBooks/1/buddies

### 7. View the address book in the browser (Thymeleaf page)
# Open this URL in a browser after running requests 1 to 5:
# http://localhost:8080/addressbook/1
GET http://localhost:8080/addressbook/1